      "claim": "The shared operation runner silently discards invalid performance configuration, allowing operations using that runner to continue instead of failing preflight.",
      "basis": "The runner discards the error from performanceSettings, although that helper can return duration-parsing and limit-validation errors; failures must not disappear and fatal prerequisites must stop work [qa-v1-block-539767426a292f490828efde, qa-v1-block-fdf550b0b7ba003a2a4a30df, qa-v1-block-307234c6bfff53948b392930].",
